			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολτύους:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κοκκύμηλα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
